 <body>

  <p>
    Masimong is a newly formed registerd NPO based in virginia in freestate province.After realizing the rate of poverty,crime and the poor conditions that the community is living in, a group of eight invividuals organised themselves and formed a NPO, which was launched on 16 january 2020.the NPO was finally registerd with the department of social development on 21 October 2020.Our focus is to ,obalise communities towards sustainable and responsible development.We believe in transformation from poverty to hope,onstacles to opportunities and fro, oppression to triumph.At Masimong NPO we celebrate the rich diversity of our country and praise many individuals and organizations who steadfastly remained committed to breaking the cycle of marginazation and poverty in south africa. 
  </p>

